<h2>Practical Planning Tips</h2>
<p><strong>Train booking:</strong> Book KTX and ITX trains in advance on the Korail website (letskorail.com) or the Korail Talk app. Seats fill up fast on weekends and holidays.</p>
<p><strong>Starting early:</strong> Most day trips work best if you leave by 8am. The earlier you go, the more time you have and the fewer crowds you'll encounter at popular sites.</p>
<p><strong>Weather:</strong> Check the forecast before a DMZ or Nami Island trip — rain significantly impacts the experience, and visibility at Dora Observatory depends on clear skies.</p>

